# `git.branch_delete`

Delete a branch in the caller's worktree.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.git.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `workspace_id` | `string?` | no |
| `name` | `string` | yes |
| `force` | `bool?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call git.branch_delete --json '{ "name": "" }'
